WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:05.000
[explosion]

00:00:16.208 --> 00:00:17.250
Evening.

00:00:19.958 --> 00:00:22.333
As if my day wasn't going badly enough.

00:00:22.958 --> 00:00:25.000
It's Trevor Belmont.

00:00:25.083 --> 00:00:27.250
You don't seem to be doing very well.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.125
What are we looking at?

00:00:29.208 --> 00:00:30.833
[Alucard] Vampires and night creatures

00:00:30.916 --> 00:00:33.041
trying to kill a castle
full of human refugees,

00:00:33.125 --> 00:00:35.000
and a madman upstairs.

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:43.583
Shall we?

00:00:57.791 --> 00:00:58.625
[grunts]

00:00:58.708 --> 00:00:59.541
[electricity crackles]

00:00:59.625 --> 00:01:01.208
[all scream]

00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:09.000
[yelling]

00:01:18.333 --> 00:01:19.708
[grunts]

00:01:56.666 --> 00:01:58.083
[grunts]

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:14.750
[squeals]

00:02:21.625 --> 00:02:23.000
[grunts]

